abstract: >-
  A reviewer-oriented Recognition–Null Kernel Engine cartridge for mathematical
  proof transport. The initial release contains source-pinned computational
  audits for cut-scalar and native Euler foundations and for native logarithm,
  finite arithmetic, prime-factorization identities, and Dirichlet-zeta
  obligations on the half-plane Re(s) > 1. Later completed-Weil and RH claims
  remain outside the certified scope.
